WEBVTT

00:16:29.037 --> 00:16:32.537
and try to explain that someone
might be right after all.

00:16:32.537 --> 00:16:34.579
So I have that contrarian

00:16:35.954 --> 00:16:37.912
aspect to what I am.

00:16:39.079 --> 00:16:44.162
This reminds me a little bit of a
possibly apocryphal story that

00:16:44.454 --> 00:16:48.454
I think told to to every doctoral student
in social science these days,

00:16:48.454 --> 00:16:52.412
which is that not long after you won
the Nobel Prize for your work

00:16:52.412 --> 00:16:53.496
on Decision-Making, there was

00:16:53.496 --> 00:16:57.746
a journalist who asked you how you made
tough decisions and you said you flip

00:16:57.746 --> 00:16:59.579
a coin. Is this true? No.